            "liquid": "{% comment %}\n  BLOQUE 2 — Suscripción + Confianza + Garantía (Sorelya D-tox)\n  Colocar justo debajo del selector de compra / botón añadir al carrito.\n\n  Variables editables abajo. Los tres badges (envío, pago, devolución)\n  deben coincidir con lo que dicen tus políticas reales de la tienda:\n  si el envío tarda 3-5 días, cámbialo aquí Y en la página de envíos.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n{% assign srl_sub_price     = \"€49,98\" %}\n{% assign srl_sub_interval  = \"24 días\" %}\n{% assign srl_pay_img       = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/Capture_d_ecran_le_2026-06-26_a_14.45.12_430x.png?v=1782482949\" %}\n{% assign srl_guarantee_img = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/Diseno_sin_titulo_95_430x.png?v=1786397693\" %}\n\n<div class=\"srl-b2\">\n  <style>\n    .srl-b2 {\n      --srl-ink: #1a1a1a;\n      --srl-muted: #4a4a4a;\n      --srl-green: #37533b;\n      --srl-card-bg: #f4f4f5;\n      --srl-card-border: #e6e6e8;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      color: var(--srl-ink);\n      max-width: 560px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    /* --- Suscripción --- */\n    .srl-b2__sub { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 28px; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }\n    .srl-b2__sub-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; }\n    .srl-b2__tick { flex: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--srl-green); }\n    .srl-b2__sub-item b { font-weight: 700; color: var(--srl-green); }\n\n    /* --- Medios de pago --- */\n    .srl-b2__pay { margin: 0 0 28px; text-align: center; }\n    .srl-b2__pay img { display: inline-block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }\n\n    /* --- Badges de confianza --- */\n    .srl-b2__badges { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n    .srl-b2__badge {\n      background: var(--srl-card-bg);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 18px 10px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .srl-b2__badge svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; color: var(--srl-green); margin-bottom: 10px; }\n    .srl-b2__badge p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--srl-ink); }\n\n    /* --- Garantía --- */\n    .srl-b2__guarantee {\n      background: var(--srl-card-bg);\n      border: 1px solid var(--srl-card-border);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 36px 28px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .srl-b2__guarantee img { width: 96px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 22px; display: block; }\n    .srl-b2__guarantee h3 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.2; }\n    .srl-b2__guarantee p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--srl-muted); margin: 0; max-width: 420px; margin-inline: auto; }\n\n    @media (max-width: 749px) {\n      .srl-b2__sub-item { font-size: 15px; }\n      .srl-b2__badges { gap: 10px; }\n      .srl-b2__badge { padding: 14px 6px; }\n      .srl-b2__badge p { font-size: 12.5px; }\n      .srl-b2__guarantee { padding: 28px 20px; }\n      .srl-b2__guarantee h3 { font-size: 22px; }\n      .srl-b2__guarantee p { font-size: 15px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <!-- Suscripción -->\n  <ul class=\"srl-b2__sub\">\n    <li class=\"srl-b2__sub-item\">\n      <svg class=\"srl-b2__tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10.5l4.5 4.5L17 5.5\"/></svg>\n      <span>Recarga de <b>{{ srl_sub_price }}</b> cada {{ srl_sub_interval }}</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"srl-b2__sub-item\">\n      <svg class=\"srl-b2__tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10.5l4.5 4.5L17 5.5\"/></svg>\n      <span><b>Sin compromiso</b> &middot; Cancela cuando quieras</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <!-- Medios de pago -->\n  <div class=\"srl-b2__pay\">\n    <img src=\"{{ srl_pay_img }}\" alt=\"Métodos de pago aceptados: Visa, Mastercard, American Express, PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Klarna, Shop Pay, UnionPay\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"430\">\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Badges -->\n  <div class=\"srl-b2__badges\">\n    <div class=\"srl-b2__badge\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 16v-2l-8-5V3.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-3 0V9l-8 5v2l8-2.5V19l-2 1.5V22l3.5-1 3.5 1v-1.5L13 19v-5.5L21 16z\"/></svg>\n      <p>Envío gratis<br>en 24-48h</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"srl-b2__badge\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l8 3.5v6c0 4.7-3.4 9-8 10.5-4.6-1.5-8-5.8-8-10.5v-6L12 2z\"/></svg>\n      <p>Pago 100%<br>seguro</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"srl-b2__badge\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h9a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2h3.2a1 1 0 0 1 .8.4L21 12.3V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.1a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-4.8 0H9.9a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-4.8 0H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V6zm11 4v3h5v-.4L17.2 10H14z\"/></svg>\n      <p>Devolución<br>30 días</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Garantía -->\n  <div class=\"srl-b2__guarantee\">\n    <img src=\"{{ srl_guarantee_img }}\" alt=\"Garantía de satisfacción 100% - devolución del dinero\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"96\">\n    <h3>Garantía de satisfacción 100%</h3>\n    <p>Si no estás completamente satisfecho con tu compra, te devolvemos tu dinero. Sin preguntas.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          }
