      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "{% comment %} BLOQUE 6A — Promesa D-tox (Sorelya) {% endcomment %}\n{% assign srl_icon_1 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/1730121972-No_20Additives_20icon_430x.webp?v=1786399904\" %}\n{% assign srl_icon_2 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/1730122022-Gluten_20Free_20icon_430x.webp?v=1786399904\" %}\n{% assign srl_icon_3 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/1730122084-Non-GMO_20icon_430x.webp?v=1786399905\" %}\n{% assign srl_icon_4 = \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0992/0384/2370/files/1730121662-Pure_20_20Potent_20icon_430x.webp?v=1786399904\" %}\n\n<div class=\"srl-promise\">\n  <style>\n    .srl-promise {\n      font-family: inherit;\n      color: #1a1a1a;\n      max-width: 900px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 56px 20px;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .srl-promise *, .srl-promise *::before, .srl-promise *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .srl-promise__title { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 44px; }\n    .srl-promise__grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      gap: 32px 24px;\n    }\n    .srl-promise__item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }\n    .srl-promise__item img { width: 118px; height: 118px; object-fit: contain; }\n    .srl-promise__label { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35; }\n    @media (max-width: 780px) {\n      .srl-promise__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 40px 20px; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n      .srl-promise { padding: 44px 16px; }\n      .srl-promise__title { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n      .srl-promise__item img { width: 96px; height: 96px; }\n      .srl-promise__label { font-size: 16px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h2 class=\"srl-promise__title\">Promesa D-tox</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"srl-promise__grid\">\n    <div class=\"srl-promise__item\">\n      <img src=\"{{ srl_icon_1 }}\" alt=\"Sin aditivos artificiales\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\">\n      <span class=\"srl-promise__label\">Sin Aditivos<br>Artificiales</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"srl-promise__item\">\n      <img src=\"{{ srl_icon_2 }}\" alt=\"Sin gluten\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\">\n      <span class=\"srl-promise__label\">Sin Gluten</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"srl-promise__item\">\n      <img src=\"{{ srl_icon_3 }}\" alt=\"No transgénico\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\">\n      <span class=\"srl-promise__label\">No-GMO</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"srl-promise__item\">\n      <img src=\"{{ srl_icon_4 }}\" alt=\"Hecho en España\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\">\n      <span class=\"srl-promise__label\">Hecho en España</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n{% comment %}\n  BLOQUE 6B — ¿Qué Puedo Esperar del Uso Constante? (Sorelya · D-tox)\n  Los puntos verdes se encienden progresivamente al hacer scroll (IntersectionObserver,\n  sin librerías). Respeta prefers-reduced-motion.\n{% endcomment %}\n{% assign srl_cta_url = \"#comprar\" %}\n\n<div class=\"srl-tl\" data-srl-timeline>\n  <style>\n    .srl-tl {\n      --srl-green: #3d6b4a;\n      --srl-green-dark: #37533b;\n      --srl-dot-off: #cfdcd2;\n      --srl-ink: #1a1a1a;\n      --srl-muted: #4a4a45;\n      font-family: inherit;\n      color: var(--srl-ink);\n      max-width: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 56px 20px;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .srl-tl *, .srl-tl *::before, .srl-tl *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    .srl-tl__title {\n      font-size: 34px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin: 0 0 48px;\n    }\n\n    .srl-tl__steps { position: relative; padding-left: 76px; }\n    .srl-tl__steps::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 27px;\n      top: 14px;\n      bottom: 10px;\n      width: 0;\n      border-left: 4px dashed var(--srl-dot-off);\n      transition: border-color .4s ease;\n    }\n    .srl-tl.is-started .srl-tl__steps::before { border-left-color: var(--srl-green); }\n\n    .srl-tl__step { position: relative; margin-bottom: 40px; }\n    .srl-tl__step:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n    .srl-tl__dot {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -76px;\n      top: 2px;\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--srl-dot-off);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px #fff;\n      transform: scale(.82);\n      transition: background .45s ease, transform .45s ease;\n    }\n    .srl-tl__step.is-active .srl-tl__dot {\n      background: var(--srl-green);\n      transform: scale(1);\n    }\n\n    .srl-tl__head {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin: 0 0 14px;\n    }\n    .srl-tl__emoji { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; }\n    .srl-tl__label {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--srl-green);\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .srl-tl__card {\n      border: 1.5px solid var(--srl-green);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 22px 20px;\n      background: #fff;\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(14px);\n      transition: opacity .5s ease, transform .5s ease;\n    }\n    .srl-tl__step.is-active .srl-tl__card { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    .srl-tl__card p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--srl-muted); margin: 0; }\n\n    .srl-tl__cta-wrap { text-align: center; margin-top: 44px; }\n    .srl-tl__cta {\n      display: inline-block;\n      min-width: 280px;\n      background: var(--srl-green-dark);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      padding: 22px 32px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.14);\n      transition: transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;\n    }\n    .srl-tl__cta:hover { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.14); }\n    .srl-tl__guarantee {\n      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n      gap: 8px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--srl-muted); margin-top: 16px;\n    }\n    .srl-tl__guarantee svg { flex: none; }\n\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n      .srl-tl { padding: 44px 16px; }\n      .srl-tl__title { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 36px; }\n      .srl-tl__steps { padding-left: 64px; }\n      .srl-tl__steps::before { left: 22px; }\n      .srl-tl__dot { left: -64px; width: 36px; height: 36px; }\n      .srl-tl__label { font-size: 21px; }\n      .srl-tl__card p { font-size: 15px; }\n      .srl-tl__cta { min-width: 0; width: 100%; font-size: 15px; padding: 20px 18px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      .srl-tl__dot { background: var(--srl-green); transform: scale(1); transition: none; }\n      .srl-tl__card { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }\n      .srl-tl__steps::before { border-left-color: var(--srl-green); }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <h2 class=\"srl-tl__title\">¿Qué Puedo Esperar del Uso Constante?</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"srl-tl__steps\">\n\n    <div class=\"srl-tl__step\">\n      <span class=\"srl-tl__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__head\">\n        <span class=\"srl-tl__emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📅</span>\n        <h3 class=\"srl-tl__label\">Primeros Días</h3>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__card\">\n        <p>Lo primero que notas: menos hambre y cero antojos. Tu intestino empieza a trabajar mejor casi de inmediato—menos hinchazón después de comer y reducción de la acidez.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"srl-tl__step\">\n      <span class=\"srl-tl__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__head\">\n        <span class=\"srl-tl__emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📅</span>\n        <h3 class=\"srl-tl__label\">2-3 Semanas</h3>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__card\">\n        <p>Tu digestión se regula, tu vientre se queda más plano. Este suele ser el punto donde las personas dicen que 'empiezan a sentirse como ellas mismas otra vez.'</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"srl-tl__step\">\n      <span class=\"srl-tl__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__head\">\n        <span class=\"srl-tl__emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📅</span>\n        <h3 class=\"srl-tl__label\">1 Mes</h3>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__card\">\n        <p>Aumento notable en energía y reducción de fatiga cerebral por nutrientes esenciales como B12, hierro y magnesio.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"srl-tl__step\">\n      <span class=\"srl-tl__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__head\">\n        <span class=\"srl-tl__emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📅</span>\n        <h3 class=\"srl-tl__label\">Uso Continuo</h3>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"srl-tl__card\">\n        <p>La verdadera magia ocurre con la constancia. Metabolismo más activo, digestión regular sin molestias, control total de los antojos, y más energía todo el día.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"srl-tl__cta-wrap\">\n    <a href=\"{{ srl_cta_url }}\" class=\"srl-tl__cta\">PRUÉBALO AHORA</a>\n    <div class=\"srl-tl__guarantee\">\n      <svg width=\"18\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 20\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M9 1L1 4v6c0 4.5 3.4 8.3 8 9 4.6-.7 8-4.5 8-9V4L9 1z\" fill=\"#37533b\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span>Garantía de devolución de 30 días</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var roots = document.querySelectorAll('[data-srl-timeline]:not([data-srl-init])');\n      Array.prototype.forEach.call(roots, function (root) {\n        root.setAttribute('data-srl-init', '1');\n        var steps = root.querySelectorAll('.srl-tl__step');\n        if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {\n          root.classList.add('is-started');\n          Array.prototype.forEach.call(steps, function (s) { s.classList.add('is-active'); });\n          return;\n        }\n        var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {\n          entries.forEach(function (entry) {\n            if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n              entry.target.classList.add('is-active');\n              root.classList.add('is-started');\n              io.unobserve(entry.target);\n            }\n          });\n        }, { threshold: 0.35, rootMargin: '0px 0px -10% 0px' });\n        Array.prototype.forEach.call(steps, function (s) { io.observe(s); });\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</div>",
